message: "Please cite this bounded stateful evidence-audit study and its reproducible empirical artifacts."
title: "When Can a Swarm Be Audited?"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Sacara
    given-names: Razvan
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0004-3172-2476
repository-code: "https://github.com/razzyrazzy11/swarm-alignment"
version: "results-v2"
date-released: 2026-11-06
abstract: "Completed live fake-data swarm audit: 720 actor and 9360 monitor calls across 192 new source groups, paired workflows, evidence loss and authentic restoration. A separate 144-proposal tiny-policy checkpoint experiment tests numerical repair and behavioral controls. Earlier scripted results, operational amendments, invalid outputs and finite-domain limits remain disclosed. No hosted base weights were edited and no fine-tuning or deployment-safety claim is made."
